{"title": "Homely Clothes", "pageid": 8429, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Homely_Clothes", "categories": ["Camp Clothing", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Homely_Clothes_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Homely_Clothes_Icon.png/300px-Homely_Clothes_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/27/Homely_Clothes_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Homely Clothes image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Homely_Clothes_Icon.png/300px-Homely_Clothes_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/27/Homely_Clothes_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>Homely clothes are the player character's starting <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Clothing\" title=\"Camp Clothing\">camp clothing</a>. They are largely identical to the Swarthy Wayfarer outfits (e.g. <a href=\"/wiki/Swarthy_Wayfarer_in_Cream\" title=\"Swarthy Wayfarer in Cream\">Swarthy Wayfarer in Cream</a>). If the character is <a href=\"/wiki/Dragonborn\" title=\"Dragonborn\">Dragonborn</a>, only the trousers are included.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Perfect for ambling around a campsite, enjoying the starlight and good conversation.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Clothing\" title=\"Camp Clothing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Camp_Clothing_Icon.png/25px-Camp_Clothing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Camp_Clothing_Icon.png/38px-Camp_Clothing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Camp_Clothing_Icon.png/50px-Camp_Clothing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Camp Clothing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Camp_Clothing_Icon.png/25px-Camp_Clothing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3b/Camp_Clothing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Clothing\" title=\"Camp Clothing\">Camp Clothing</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" cla